              </p>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-card/60 border border-border/60 text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground space-y-1 mb-3">
                <div>zerotier-idtool initmoon identity.public &gt; moon.json</div>
                <div>zerotier-idtool genmoon moon.json</div>
